<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμᾰθ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>string, chain,</i> or <i>cluster</i> of things hanging
			one from the other, as of <i>beads</i> or <i>the links of a
				chain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				533e
			</span></i>; of bats, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεοττιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					559a8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριβανωτῶν, ἰσχάδων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				765
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				647
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					914
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαξῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.2
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθουσιαζόντων, χορευτῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				533e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				536a
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμματιδίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					6.8
				</span></i>
			 ; perh. of a <i>chain</i> of reasoning, Polystr.<i><span class="en">
				p.9
			</span></i> W., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.186
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.698
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Anacreont.</u>
					13.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. ψάμμου</span> a <i>revolving</i>
			sand-eddy, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				419b24
			</span></i>.</div>
